om bdRight" style="width: 17%; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63854/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63854" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63854"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasxzuggb/"></a>Комитет казначейства при Министерстве экономики и финансов</td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63855/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63855" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63855"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasdpmdog/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 47%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63856/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63856" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63856"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas1g7qx1/"></a>Автоматически перечисляет сумму налога на банковский счет налогоплательщика в рамках средств Государственного бюджета (при наличии достаточных средств).</p></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63857/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63857" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63857"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasfcwaq8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 15%; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63858/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63858" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63858"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas09qgyx/"></a>В тот же день</td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" style="width: 12%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63859/" data-role="phrase-a