></div><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63866/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63866" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63866"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfash3r8do/"></a>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 1-2<br>к Положению о порядке возмещения<br>суммы налога на добавленную стоимость</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="2"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20882/tit1327/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63867/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63867" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63867"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasuzz4yd/"></a>СХЕМА<br><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasvz6psc/"></a>РАССМОТРЕНИЯ ЗАЯВЛЕНИЯ О ВОЗВРАТЕ НА БАНКОВСКИЙ СЧЕТ НАЛОГОПЛАТЕЛЬЩИКА СУММЫ НАЛОГА НА ДОБАВЛЕННУЮ СТОИМОСТЬ, ПОДЛЕЖАЩЕЙ ВОЗМЕЩЕНИЮ ПРОИЗВОДИТЕЛЯМ СЕЛЬСКОХОЗЯЙСТВЕННОЙ ПРОДУКЦИИ</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 12%; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63868/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63868" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63868"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfaseteti8/"></a><strong>Этапы</strong></td><td class="bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 2%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63869/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63869" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63869"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas24xho7/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63870/" data