Right" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63980/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63980" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63980"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasqgepke/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63981/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63981" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63981"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasmnan63/"></a><strong>до</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 17%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63982/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63982" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63982"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasae19az/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63983/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63983" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63983"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasiczx8y/"></a>(дд.мм.гггг)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63984/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63984" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63984"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas6voxk4/"></a>(дд.мм.гггг)</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 28%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63985/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63985" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63985"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfaso5657y/"></a>Сумма</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="4" style="width: 68%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63986/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63986" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63986"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasfwvu56/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 28%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63987/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63987" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63987"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas10o9v8/"></a>Порядок возмещения</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="4" style="width: 68%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63988/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63988" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63988"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasu2k498/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="4" style="width: 68%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63989/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63989" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63989"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas76yk3m/"></a>(общеустановленный, ускоренный)</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 28%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63990/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63990" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63990"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasrl8m7a/"></a>Документы, приложенные к заявлению</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63991/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63991" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63991"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasm6czpf/"></a><strong>ВЫБОР ФАЙЛА</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63992/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63992" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63992"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasgpfr2a/"></a><strong>ВЫБОР ФАЙЛА</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63993/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63993" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63993"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasl5h4ec/"></a>Расчет суммы превышения НДС, возвращаемой на банковский счет налогоплательщика</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63994/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63994" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63994"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas9ddklw/"></a>(Приложение № 6).</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63995/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63995" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63995"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasdhi4pg/"></a>Расчет пересчета иностранной валюты в национальную валюту по курсу, установленному ЦБ РУз на последний день месяца, в котором осуществлялась отгрузка.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63996/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63996" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63996"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasw1zm2e/"></a>Банковская гарантия,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63997/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63997" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63997"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasa109oz/"></a>договор залога</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 28%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63998/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63998" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63998"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasp5q9gl/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr63999/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="63999" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr63999"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasxzscoh/"></a><strong>ВЫБОР ФАЙЛА</strong></p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64000/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64000" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64000"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasu1obtz/"></a><strong>ВЫБОР ФАЙЛА</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 28%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64001/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64001" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64001"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfass0mchu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64002/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64002" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64002"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasuo01t5/"></a>Данные об экспорте товаров и поступлении валюты</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64003/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64003" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64003"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasmoc6fc/"></a>(Приложение № 4)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 34%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64004/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64004" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64004"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas0uq7id/"></a>Реестр единых международных перевозочных документов, сведения по оказанным населению коммунальным услугам, другие документы</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 28%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64005/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64005" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64005"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas87io2i/"></a>Дата представления заявления</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="4" style="width: 68%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64006/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64006" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64006"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas15wyfh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="4" style="width: 68%; word