13" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64013"></a><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20882/tit112/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas6haghh/"></a>ПРИЛОЖЕНИЕ № 3&#160;к Положению</p><div class="doc__untyped" data-type="untyped" data-level="2"><a data-role="toc" data-anchor="/document/90/20882/tit1329/"></a><span level="" style="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64014/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64014" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64014"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasalsrx1/"></a>ЗАЯВЛЕНИЕ&#160;&#160;<br>о возврате суммы налога&#160;на добавленную стоимость дипломатическим&#160;представительствам, консульским учреждениям&#160;зарубежных государств и приравненным к ним&#160;организациям, аккредитованным&#160;в Республике Узбекистан</span></div><div align="center"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width: 29%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64015/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64015" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64015"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasvru2p8/"></a>Налоговый орган, в который представляется заявление</p></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style="width: 71%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64016/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="64016" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr64016"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfas3hw2qo/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 71%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr64017/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="