/20882/dfase2b79h/"></a>5 - коллективные инвестиции и (или) другие формы доверительного управления</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width:36%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr15676/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15676" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15676"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasxd91br/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr15677/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15677" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15677"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasf01byf/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr15678/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15678" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15678"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasludca5/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td style="width:18%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr15679/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15679" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15679"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfasgw9ms5/"></a>3 - товарищество</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr15680/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15680" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15680"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfaspm5gl6/"></a><strong>3.</strong><strong>Наименование иностранной структуры без образования юридического лица </strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/bssPhr15681/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="15681" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr15681"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/20882/dfaskay6